items.LD_Pale_Rider_Statue.name = Death's Reaper Form Statue
items.LD_Pale_Rider_Statue.description = Death's fearsome Reaper transformation stands in miniature: a hooded skull-mask, sweeping crescent and skeletal wings rise above a funerary plinth. An original Hytale tribute to Darksiders II, recalling the Rider's true form and the still Reaper statue left by Soul Splitter.
items.LD_Well_of_Souls.name = Well of Souls Miniature
items.LD_Well_of_Souls.description = A small carved basin holds a still pool of spectral green beneath the suggestion of an ancient threshold. This original Hytale miniature honors the Well of Souls sought by Death in Darksiders II, whose entrance requires the keys kept by angels and demons.
items.LD_Tree_of_Death.name = Tree of Death Miniature
items.LD_Tree_of_Death.description = Bare black branches twist above pale root-bones and a small green hollow. This original Hytale keepsake recalls the Tree of Death, the shadowy reflection of the Tree of Life encountered in Darksiders II's Kingdom of the Dead. A fragment of that distant, silent landscape for a private room.
items.LD_Book_of_the_Dead.name = Book of the Dead Lectern
items.LD_Book_of_the_Dead.description = A heavy tome rests on a bone-bound lectern, its worn pages held beneath dark chains and a carved skull seal. This original Hytale tribute recalls the lost Book of the Dead pages collected for Vulgrim in Darksiders II, where completed chapters lead to the sealed Death Tombs.
